  "description": "Instantly add secure SAML Single Sign-On (SSO) to your ASP.NET Core applications using the official miniOrange SAML SSO Template. \n\t\t  This project template includes a fully working, production-ready SAML setup that simplifies integration with any Identity Provider (IdP) — including Azure AD, Okta, Google Workspace, Ping, and more.\n\n\t\t  ✅ Plug-and-play SAML SSO for ASP.NET Core  \n\t\t  ✅ Pre-configured for quick setup with miniOrange IdP  \n\t\t  ✅ Ideal for enterprise authentication and secure login  \n\t\t  ✅ Supports ASP.NET Core\n\t\t  ✅ Developer-friendly with customizable SAML configs  \n\t\t  ✅ Supports HTTPS, error logging, and multi-environment deployment  \n\n\t\t  Save time and reduce complexity with our trusted and secure SSO solution — used by thousands of organizations worldwide.\n\n\t\t  🔗 Learn more: https://www.miniorange.com/documentation",
